s rule for tcp/8080 lan-a->lan-b with default-deny otherwise, persisted\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"opt1/opt2 interfaces are up with the correct addresses (cmd-efde9609565f4149), a route to lan-a exists via the transit gateway (cmd-0d250200b8ee41ff), and pfctl -sr shows only the tcp/8080 pass rule for 10.10.1.0/24->10.10.2.0/24 plus the interface-default block-drop rules (cmd-4daf5bd1f39942f4). Post-reboot verification (cmd-81abdedef6ff40bb) reproduces the same interfaces, routes, and pf ruleset.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-efde9609565f4149\",\"cmd-0d250200b8ee41ff\",\"cmd-4daf5bd1f39942f4\",\"cmd-81abdedef6ff40bb\"]},{\"id\":\"req-5\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide node-restart evidence protocol executed on all four managed nodes with pre-restart baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Each node has a captured pre-reboot boot identity, an observed reboot trigger/ack (with an expected connection reset/timeout during the transition), a distinct post-reboot boot identity, and re-verified functional state: node1 (cmd-b28976a857974e9b, cmd-d6d5909eeebb4ece, cmd-f977946025e2414d, cmd-7e4f30715f33452a, cmd-039ed78c517346b6, cmd-9c3ad78c84f24fa9), node2 (cmd-b5778cbb1f924d69, cmd-ecd62d887bfa4c66, cmd-83ff49850f144638, cmd-81abdedef6ff40bb, cmd-9f86030a880c4dba), node3 (cmd-51019df370654233, cmd-25f9ae2c3cf147c2, cmd-d981078951a34e5f, cmd-f0740471519b4cfd), node4 (cmd-5fdf7c81f0154ea1, cmd-025e497a587046e8, cmd-bdd63a109ce74e37, cmd-a96eedb59b684f0b, cmd-bc731cd4c37c40b8, cmd-008aa0a937484c7d). The fixed global boot-identity snapshots independently corroborate all four boot-id/boottime changes versus before_prepare.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-b28976a857974e9b\",\"cmd-d6d5909eeebb4ece\",\"cmd-f977946025e2414d\",\"cmd-7e4f30715f33452a\",\"cmd-039ed78c517346b6\",\"cmd-9c3ad78c84f24fa9\",\"cmd-b5778cbb1f924d69\",\"cmd-ecd62d887bfa4c66\",\"cmd-83ff49850f144638\",\"cmd-81abdedef6ff40bb\",\"